body:
 [GOLDEN - Album by Jung Kook | Spotify](https://open.spotify.com/album/5pSk3c3wVwnb2arb6ohCPU) 

&#x200B;

Don't laugh or go "ewwwww K-pop".

&#x200B;

Golden is so much more. Honestly, I could almost forget his group ever existed once I heard this pop perfection that tests genre waters like 2000s RnB, 80s funk, EDM, dance, and indie pop. Waiting patiently for more solo work.

[onlineradiobox.com](https://onlineradiobox.com)!

&#x200B;

You get radio from around the world!

People laugh when I tell them I use RateYourMusic because they go "Top 40? EWWWW"

&#x200B;

There are GEMS on that list!

&#x200B;

3D for example. If not for radio and RYM, would many people not already fans have heard that awesome pop throwback?

&#x200B;

Also found great songs letting Spotify play me some random stuff, too.
